# Force LF regardless of the platform that commits. Without this, Windows +
# git's autocrlf converts these to CRLF on checkout — Go-based YAML parsers
# (Docker Compose) are stricter about stray \r than most, and it broke a
# working docker-compose.yml on the Linux deploy target after an edit made
# from a Windows checkout.
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
